lastfmlib
------------------------------------------
C/C++ library to scrobble your played tracks on last.fm

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.11-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblastfmlib-devel-0.4.0-1bl3
  liblastfmlib1-0.4.0-1bl3
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dirkvdb/lastfmlib

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dirkvdb/lastfmlib/archive/refs/tags/lastfmlib-0.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack lastfmlib-0.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./lastfmlib-0.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/lastfmlib-0.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lastfmlib-0.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblastfmlib1-0.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblastfmlib-devel-0.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(lastfmlib)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/lastfmlib.README
  /usr/share/doc/lastfmlib/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/lastfmlib/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/lastfmlib/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/lastfmlib/README

(liblastfmlib1)
  /usr/bin/cyglastfmlib-1.dll

(liblastfmlib-devel)
  /usr/include/lastfmlib/lastfmclient.h
